  "title": "MKA: Correctly store the ICK",
  "description": "The ICK is currently calculated but being written to the same place\nin the record as the KEK. The ICK is not yet used to verify the ICV,\nand the KEK is calculated second, so this does not yet have an effect.\n\nAlso, move the log domain define to immediately after including\nconfig.h - if it is defined after a header that includes the logging\nsystem, the domain will not be correctly defined.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
